@startuml
title <size:24>Deployment View: Production</size>\n<size:24>Where containers actually run. Note the astronomy-db node: Catalog DB and Accounting DB are separate schemas co-located on one Postgres instance — a physical fact the static container views deliberately hide. Cross-cutting telemetry/feature-flag edges are omitted for clarity.</size>

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam ranksep 20
skinparam nodesep 5
hide stereotype

